From: deCodeUx <t@t>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 16:43:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(evidence): complete authoritative verification schema and
 matrix
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Create packages/orchestration/verification_matrix.py with typed producer
and completeness validator for verification_tests.json.

The run producer validates types (rejects bool-as-int, negative counts,
malformed run_id). The tests producer derives all top-level fields
(command, exit_code, passed, failed, test_files) from individual runs —
no field is caller-asserted at the aggregate level. Rejects duplicate
run_ids and empty inputs.

The completeness validator checks all required suites are present in the
run commands, top-level counts equal sum of runs, and run_ids are unique.
Producer output passes the existing VerificationTestsV1 validator in
build_review_manifest.py. 23 contract tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
